    "Read-only. Backward paging is not available because 68000 instructions are variable length — use Goto Address to move back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "読み取り専用。68000 は可変長命令のため前ページへは戻れません — 戻る場合はアドレスを直接指定してください。"
          }
        }
